WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.600
Step 1: Start a 3D World project. Start building → Key Stage 2 → 3D World.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:14.000
Step 2: Tap a thing to find its block. Before Run the world shows how it starts. Tapping a thing lights up the block that made it.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.200
Step 3: Drag its arrows to move it. The new numbers are written back into its block.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.400
Step 4: Add characters, models and code. Characters, Models, Events, Motion, Physics, Camera, Sound …

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.400
Step 5: Press Run to play. Arrow keys walk, Space jumps, and the camera follows.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:32.200
Step 6: Stop puts everything back. Stop returns to the start, ready to change one thing and run again.
